  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SnowflakeOASIS v2.0.2\n\nSnowflake OASIS Provider - cloud data warehouse for OASIS holons and avatars via the Snowflake ADO.NET connector. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- Automate coordinated OASIS platform releases (7ed2053)\n- docs(packages): add missing NuGet guides and release setup sections (77c65ea)\n- Eliminate remaining NuGet vulnerabilities (739aeee)\n- feat(providers): add 11 analytical and RESP-compatible storage providers (161 total) (d2eedce)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- fix(packaging): explicitly include newly documented package readmes (5be30be)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SnowflakeOASIS",
